      "content": "Await both reads with Promise.all before processing their results. If the shared readSnapshot rejects, both `scanning` and `reading` reject, but awaiting `scanning` exits `series` before a rejection handler is attached to `reading`. This produces an unhandled rejection even when the caller catches the series error (and can terminate Node processes). Promise.all preserves the shared batch while handling both failures.",
